#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラ…壊してやりたいけど、
#. 壊したら、ボクも壊される…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really wanna smash that camera. But if I break *it*\n"
"Monokuma will break *me*.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無視するしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I'll just have to try and ignore it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちも鉄板…あっちも鉄板…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Metal plate here... Metal plate over there, too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本来の教室なら窓があるべき場所…
#. だが、そこにはやっぱり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In any normal classroom, this is where a window would\n"
"be. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄板のような物が打ち付けられていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's some kind of huge metal plate mounted over\n"
"it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 都合よく外れていたりする訳ないか。
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I doubt it'd be easy to get that thing off."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計があって時間はわかるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a clock telling me what time it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外が見えないんじゃ、
#. それが正しいのかもわからないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can't see outside, so I have no idea if it's\n"
"even right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
